rot-intelligent-recipe = { $name } · { $cost } biomass · { $width }×{ $height }
rot-intelligent-ready = Select a building, then choose a location on your tissue.
rot-intelligent-placement-hint = Selecting a building enables placement. Right-click cancels targeting. The outline shows its footprint; occupancy and connectivity are checked when ordered. Cancel a project in Growth to recover unspent biomass.
rot-intelligent-camera-alert = Under attack: { $name }
rot-intelligent-cancel = Cancel growth
rot-intelligent-repair = Healing
rot-intelligent-dissolve = Dissolving
rot-intelligent-project-invalid = Growth cancelled: the site is no longer suitable or connected to the colony. Biomass refunded.
rot-intelligent-project-limit = All growth channels are occupied. Wait or cancel a project.
rot-intelligent-no-grid = The core must be anchored on the same grid.
rot-intelligent-not-visible = The colony cannot see that location.
rot-intelligent-occupied = That footprint is occupied or reserved by another project.
rot-intelligent-other-colony = This belongs to another living colony.
rot-intelligent-territory-limit = The colony has reached its territory limit.
rot-intelligent-needs-floor = The entire footprint needs existing floor.
rot-intelligent-needs-territory = The entire footprint needs tissue connected to the core. New tissue grows from an adjacent tile.
rot-intelligent-exhaust-blocked = The flagellum's tail needs open space beyond its tip.
rot-intelligent-insufficient-biomass = Not enough biomass.
rot-intelligent-repair-unavailable = This organ is healthy or was recently damaged. Healing is unavailable.
rot-intelligent-adopted = The creature joined the colony.
rot-intelligent-rally-set = The rally point lasts 30 seconds.
rot-intelligent-in-ftl = Anchoring cannot change during FTL transit.
rot-intelligent-bedrock-anchor = This grid has a bedrock anchor and cannot be released.
rot-intelligent-unanchored = Grid released. Engines and a gyroscope are required for movement.
rot-intelligent-pilot-busy = Another pilot is controlling this grid.
rot-intelligent-cannot-pilot = Cannot take control of this grid now.
rot-organ-disconnected = This organ is disconnected from the core's living tissue.
rot-nursery-progress = Time to maturity: { $seconds } s.
rot-nester-reserve = Nutrition reserve: { $percent }%.
rot-intelligent-no-cameras = No vision sources are available.
rot-intelligent-no-projects = No work is in progress.
rot-intelligent-placement-ready = Ready to order growth. The core will check reservations.
rot-nursery-blocked = Mature. Waiting for a clear exit.

ent-ActionRotIntelligentRoot = Uproot / take root
    .desc = Switch between rooted and mobile forms over 3 seconds. Movement or damage interrupts the transition. Colony controls are unavailable while mobile.
rot-intelligent-root-blocked = A creature or structure is in the way. Choose an unoccupied tile.
rot-intelligent-rooted = You have taken root. Connections to your colony are being restored.
rot-intelligent-mobile = Your roots retract. You now control your body; take root to restore colony abilities.
